  "notes": [
    "On this form the compensation cells for group I (Elective, Permanent) span several appointment rows. Counts are recorded on the individual rows; the group's printed amounts are recorded once on the row 'I. Elective / Permanent' (count null), so nothing is double counted. Likewise for group II (Temporary, Contractual: Casual, Confidentials/Co-Terminous).",
    "The row printed 'Contractual : Casual' is keyed 'casual'; the separate 'Confidentials/Co-Terminous' row is keyed 'coterminous'.",
